NOTICE

The combat engine is generated directly from the open-source OSRS Wiki DPS
Calculator:

  https://github.com/weirdgloop/osrs-dps-calc
  License: GNU General Public License v3.0

The exact pinned revision is recorded in
src/vendor/osrs-wiki/version.json. Run `npm run sync:dps-engine` to update the
generated engine from upstream.

Which itself acknowledges Bitterkoekje's DPS spreadsheet and OSRS Wiki
contributors for item, monster, and spell data.

This project is an independent implementation inspired by the feature set of
GearScape (https://gearscape.net/). It does not include GearScape proprietary
source code, assets, or branding.

Game data is sourced from the Old School RuneScape Wiki
(https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/) under applicable wiki licensing.
